@krasnov_victory
on-arrival: instability -= 5; workers_b += 10; soldiers_b += 10; leninist_strength += 5; 

= Bolshevik Victory

Despite fearing the worst, it turns out that both parties possessed far fewer numbers and far weaker resolve than expected. The two also fall to coordinate with each other or time their actions successfully, making it relatively easy to crush the "Committee for Salvation" forces separately before Kerensky even mounts his attack. After some brief skirmishes on the edge of the capital, Kerensky's forces break and disperse. 


@krasnov_defeat

= Defeat 

The counterrevolutionaries have taken over Petrograd! Kerensky's forces sweep over the defenders, disarming the workers' militias and the rebellious garrisons. 


- @game_over: A story for another time.

